<div class="content-box" style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Hardware Roles: Confusing actuators (which do the work, e.g., a motor) with sensors (which get the data).</li>
        <li>Open vs. Closed: Assuming open-loop systems are "bad." They are often chosen for simplicity and cost in predictable environments.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

